  "translate_en|mods/TheyKnewTooMuch/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_TheyKnewTooMuch_ZomboxamineChance_tooltip": "Chance every couple of seconds that an ordinary zombie chasing you loses track. Blackout Predators special zombies are never fooled.",
